source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: css/selector/nested-selector-list-leading-comments.css
---

# Input

```css
.a {
	/* first */
	& > .b,
	/* second */
	& > .c,
	& > .d {
		display: none;
	}
}

.a {
	/* first */
	.b,
	/* second */
	.c {
		display: none;
	}
}

.a {
	/* first */
	> .b,
	/* second */
	+ .c {
		display: none;
	}
}

.a {
	/* first */
	& .b,
	/* second */
	&:hover,
	/* third */
	&.active > .c {
		display: none;
	}
}

```


